  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>. Then the natural number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> for which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn></math>&nbsp;is _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given that:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn></math></p><p>As we know that,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>",
